model r6_reach
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.1.7, R6's reach (#145), from L §5's A form defined by another alone: a form means its definition, with its values, holes and refusals, their messages naming the form as written. Features no item of R6 names: next(K, d) with no member yet (n_*: next and the first it is, one hole each, each naming its own form), and low over days a hole movement reaches (l_*: low and the min it is)"

source card "T's card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input fee: money PLN

input late: date

input d0: date

input d1: date

input d9: date

move gift: transfers
  on late
  leg cash from world to konto amount fee

ask n_next: next(transfers, d1)

ask n_first: first(t in transfers over d1 ..) ties by t.day

ask l_low: low(konto, d0 .. d9)

ask l_min: min(bal(konto, d) for d in d0 .. d9 step 1 day)

version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  fee = ?"how much is the gift?"
  late = 2026-02-10 "before the cut"
  d0 = 2026-02-01 "the card"
  d1 = 2026-03-02 "after the cut"
  d9 = 2026-02-28 "the card"
  opening[konto] = 100.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
